  "title": "Cube Programmer API readout speed issue",
  "content": "<p>Hello, <br /><br />I have a problem with Cube Programmer API - I’m using it to read RAM addresses continuously at rates of around 300Hz using the readMemory() function. Unfortunately with every call the function starts to take more and more time to execute, causing the readout frequency to drop to 80Hz just after a few minutes. Could it be some mechanism under the hood that causes that? Is there a known workaround? <br /><br />Best Regards, </p><p>Piotr Wasilewski</p>",
